      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I am so sorry you are feeling this level of pain and isolation; your experience of your body trapping you is incredibly heavy to carry. While I cannot provide medical advice or a cure, please know that there are organizations like the Arthritis Foundation or your local hospice care team that specialize in helping patients manage these specific symptoms and reduce the physical burden. You do not have to navigate this alone, even if the weight feels overwhelming right now. It might be helpful to share these feelings with a trusted friend, doctor, or a helpline professional who can offer immediate support and resources.",
